{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worldwatch</strong> is a chaotic bullet heaven where you fight against threats\u2026 that were never actual threats.<br>The most incompetent hero organization on Earth gets everything wrong. The world is in danger\u2026 or at least that\u2019s what <i>Worldwatch</i> believes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into absurd battles against hordes of innocent enemies, unlock increasingly insane weapons, and survive the chaos that only Worldwatch\u2019s incompetence could unleash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From alien diplomats mistaken for \u201cinvaders,\u201d to a misdiagnosed zombie outbreak, all the way to time-travel experiments on the Moon gone horribly wrong\u2026 each stage in <strong>Worldwatch</strong> is a bigger disaster than the last. And when the final apocalypse arrives, the only certainty is that the \u201csolution\u201d will be even worse than the problem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordes of innocent enemies</strong>: from intergalactic diplomats to lunar tourists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied bosses</strong>, each tailored to its stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satirical humor</strong>, poking fun at paranoia and the chaos caused by those meant to save the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive\u2026 or will you just make the end of the world come faster?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013840?t=1774592551","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013840/def741c580ac7331599ec19ad0a99cfcac0986be/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774592551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013840/b7a78b68bb25296880895f7f7543569339eea0bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774592551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013840/b7a78b68bb25296880895f7f7543569339eea0bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774592551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Worldwatch</strong> is a chaotic bullet heaven where you fight against threats\u2026 that were never actual threats.<br>The most incompetent hero organization on Earth gets everything wrong. The world is in danger\u2026 or at least that\u2019s what <i>Worldwatch</i> believes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into absurd battles against hordes of innocent enemies, unlock increasingly insane weapons, and survive the chaos that only Worldwatch\u2019s incompetence could unleash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From alien diplomats mistaken for \u201cinvaders,\u201d to a misdiagnosed zombie outbreak, all the way to time-travel experiments on the Moon gone horribly wrong\u2026 each stage in <strong>Worldwatch</strong> is a bigger disaster than the last. And when the final apocalypse arrives, the only certainty is that the \u201csolution\u201d will be even worse than the problem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hordes of innocent enemies</strong>: from intergalactic diplomats to lunar tourists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Varied bosses</strong>, each tailored to its stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satirical humor</strong>, poking fun at paranoia and the chaos caused by those meant to save the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive\u2026 or will you just make the end of the world come faster?</p>","developers":["Moldy&Abet Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","